    """The dynamic transmission editor screen. It lives in
    transmission_editor.py (engine: src/heor_tree_engine/dtm_*.py) - kept
    out of this file like the NMA Editor, since app.py is edited by other
    work in parallel. NOTE: keep this delegation when editing app.py
    elsewhere (do not restore the old placeholder)."""

